/picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">Hit Points</span></a> each time.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Vampiric_Touch\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Vampiric_Touch_(Condition)\" title=\"Vampiric Touch (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/64/Vampiric_Touch_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Vampiric_Touch_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/64/Vampiric_Touch_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Vampiric_Touch_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/64/Vampiric_Touch_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Vampiric_Touch_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Vampiric Touch\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/64/Vampiric_Touch_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Vampiric_Touch_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/64/Vampiric_Touch_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Vampiric_Touch_(Condition)\" title=\"Vampiric Touch (Condition)\">Vampiric Touch</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Each turn, using an <a href=\"/wiki/Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Action\">Action</a>, can recast <a href=\"/wiki/Vampiric_Touch\" title=\"Vampiric Touch\">Vampiric Touch</a> without expending a <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spell_Slots\" title=\"Spells\">Spell Slot</a>.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202719\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.058 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.061 seconds\